			dependencies: ["44EF4C8A7F6402F1"]
			description: [
				"&l初始技能：&r"
				" "
				" &nWall Cling:&r "
				"   > While against a wall, hold &oSHIFT&r to cling to the wall"
				""
				""
				""
				"&lUnlockable Skills:&r"
				" "
				" &nLedge Grab:&r "
				"   > While against a ledge, hold &oRIGHT-CLICK&r to hold on to the edge"
				""
				" &nClimb Up:&r"
				"   > While using Ledge Grab, press &oSPACE&r to climb up."
				""
				" &nWall Jump:&r"
				"   > While using Ledge Grab or Wall Cling, look away from the ledge you are holding and press &oSPACE&r to jump away from the wall. Can be chained to another Ledge Grab or Wall Cling"
				""
				" &nWall Slide:&r"
				"   > While falling next to a wall, hold &oRIGHT-CLICK&r to slow your fall and reduce fall damage"
				""
				" &nCat Leap:&r"
				"   > While sprinting, tap &oSHIFT&r to do a long horizontal jump. "
				""
				" &nCrawl:&r "
				"   > Hold &oZ&r to crawl. Can be used to go under gaps of 1 block."
				""
				" &nSlide:&r"
				"   > While Sprinting, hold &oZ&r to Slide. Can be used to go under gaps of 1 block without losing momentum."
				""
				" &nBreakfall:&r "
				"   > While falling, Hold &oSHIFT&r and &oR&r before hitting the ground to reduce the fall damage you take."
				""
				" &nHorizontal Wallrun:&r "
				"  > While Sprinting parallel to a wall, jump towards the wall and hold &oR&r and &oCTRL&r to run along the wall. Press &oSPACE&r to jump away from the wall using Wall Jump"
				""
				" &nVertical Wallrun:&r "
				"   > While Sprinting, face a wall and look slightly up towards a ledge. Then press and hold &oSPACE&r to run up the wall. Chain this with Wall Cling or Ledge Grab."
			]
